https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134633876.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[As Capt Smit Machchhar recovers in hospital, those who know him recall the pilot, teacher and neighbour behind the headlines. Captain Smit Machchhar was attacked by his co-pilot while flying flydubai flight FZ1073 from Dubai to Tel Aviv. Despite sustaining serious injuries, he managed to maintain control of the aircraft after it dropped significantly. His actions allowed crew members and passengers to subdue the attacker, ultimately leading to a safe landing in Saudi Arabia. Friends and colleagues remember Machchhar as calm and composed, which reflects his character throughout his life.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/captain-smit-machchhar-a-steady-hand-in-and-out-of-the-cockpit/articleshow/134633876.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/captain-smit-machchhar-a-steady-hand-in-and-out-of-the-cockpit/articleshow/134633876.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-02T12:56:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Manju V</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134634242,imgsize-145426.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Portal not in accordance with law’: Congress accuses Election Commission of ‘lying’ over ECINet]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/portal-not-in-accordance-with-law-congress-accuses-election-commission-of-lying-over-ecinet/articleshow/134633526.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134633526.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/portal-not-in-accordance-with-law-congress-accuses-election-commission-of-lying-over-ecinet/articleshow/134633526.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/portal-not-in-accordance-with-law-congress-accuses-election-commission-of-lying-over-ecinet/articleshow/134633526.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-02T12:35:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134633973,imgsize-89910.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['I was reciting Hanuman Chalisa': flydubai 'hero' Captain Smit Machchhar tells PM Modi about cockpit ordeal]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/i-was-reciting-hanuman-chalisa-flydubai-hero-captain-smit-machchhar-tells-pm-modi-about-cockpit-ordeal/articleshow/134633718.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134633718.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Prime Minister Narendra Modi praised Captain Smit Machchhar for courage during a flight emergency involving a co-pilot. Machchhar recited the Hanuman Chalisa to maintain composure while facing danger, which he shared with the Prime Minister. Modi spoke with Machchhar and his family, highlighting his bravery in protecting passengers.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/i-was-reciting-hanuman-chalisa-flydubai-hero-captain-smit-machchhar-tells-pm-modi-about-cockpit-ordeal/articleshow/134633718.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/i-was-reciting-hanuman-chalisa-flydubai-hero-captain-smit-machchhar-tells-pm-modi-about-cockpit-ordeal/articleshow/134633718.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-02T12:33:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Mukherjee</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134633920,imgsize-1197409.cms"/></item></channel></rss>